  "description": "Yoo Ha-jin, who was selected as an elite agent by the global mercenary company 'Blackwater' in a short period of time for the purpose of starting a business, has been carrying out secret operations all over the world. At the behest of his wife who wants a normal life, he gives up starting a business with his friends and joins Daeho Group as a bodyguard. As a mission, he is in Macau to handle Daeho Chairman Choi Ju-myeong's slush fund, but in the process, he is misunderstood as stealing corporate secrets. He is shot by his senior and colleague Kang Woo-seung and falls into the sea...\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/58980310), [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EB%B8%94%EB%9F%AC%EB%94%94-%EC%B2%B4%EC%96%B4/3541)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Japanese](https://piccoma.com/web/product/111014)",
